# Files Fern must not modify or delete when regenerating this repo.
#
# Fern owns the SDK source and prunes anything it did not generate — it reads this file
# from the pull request's base branch, so an entry only protects a file once it is on
# main. This file has to land before Fern's first PR merges.
#
# publish-main.yml is hand-written. There is no Swift package registry: SwiftPM resolves
# this git repository and its tags directly, so the tag *is* the release. The workflow
# tags main when a merge lands a Sources/Version.swift that the remote has no tag for.
#
# Unlike the Ruby and Java generators, fern-swift-sdk 0.36.0 emits no .github directory
# at all, so there is no generated ci.yml holding a second, tag-triggered publish job.
# Verified against the generated tree on 2026-08-21; if a future generator version starts
# emitting one, add .github/workflows/ci.yml here alongside a hand-written copy.
.github/workflows/publish-main.yml
